{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_057_score_sde-title\">Score-SDE</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以连续 score field 同时定义 reverse-time SDE、predictor-corrector sampler 与同边缘的 probability-flow ODE。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Unifies discrete diffusion and score matching into a continuous-time Stochastic Differential Equation (SDE) with a corresponding deterministic Probability-Flow ODE.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">数据样本 x(0)；生成时的先验噪声 x(T)</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Continuous data sample x(0); prior noise distribution x(T) at terminal time T</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">经 reverse SDE 或 probability-flow ODE 得到的样本</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Samples generated via Predictor-Corrector reverse SDE or exact likelihoods via Probability-Flow ODE</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=PxTIG12RRHS\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_057_score_sde')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_057_score_sde')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Score-SDE original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/d336ef3c13eb64a51513.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_057_score_sde', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_057_score_sde\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_057_score_sde')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_057_score_sde', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_057_score_sde\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">数据 x(0)</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x(0</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">未知数据分布 p0</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests continuous data sample x(0); prior noise distribution x(t) at terminal time t and prepares initial tensor representations (x(0).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"未知数据分布 p0\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests continuous data sample x(0); prior noise distribution x(t) at terminal time t and prepares initial tensor representations (x(0).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"数据 x(0)\" data-node-name-en=\"x(0\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_057_score_sde', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">数据 x(0)</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x(0</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">未知数据分布 p0</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests continuous data sample x(0); prior noise distribution x(t) at terminal time t and prepares initial tensor representations (x(0).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"dx=f(x,t)dt+g(t)dW，把 p0 连续扰动到简单先验\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes SDE to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"前向 SDE\" data-node-name-en=\"SDE\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_057_score_sde', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">前向 SDE</span><span class=\"lang-en\">SDE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">dx=f(x,t)dt+g(t)dW，把 p0 连续扰动到简单先验</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes SDE to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"终点通常接近高斯噪声\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs prior pT within the core continuous score sde computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"先验 pT\" data-node-name-en=\"prior pT\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_057_score_sde', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">先验 pT</span><span class=\"lang-en\">prior pT</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">终点通常接近高斯噪声</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs prior pT within the core continuous score sde computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"s_theta(x,t)≈∇_x log p_t(x)，用连续时间 denoising score matching 训练\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Score within the core continuous score sde computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Score 网络\" data-node-name-en=\"Score\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_057_score_sde', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Score 网络</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Score</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">s_theta(x,t)≈∇_x log p_t(x)，用连续时间 denoising score matching 训练</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Score within the core continuous score sde computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"漂移含 -g(t)^2 s_theta，并保留随机扩散项\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Reverse SDE within the core continuous score sde computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Reverse SDE\" data-node-name-en=\"Reverse SDE\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_057_score_sde', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Reverse SDE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">漂移含 -g(t)^2 s_theta，并保留随机扩散项</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Reverse SDE within the core continuous score sde computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"数值离散 reverse SDE 前进一步\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Predictor within the core continuous score sde computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Predictor\" data-node-name-en=\"Predictor\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_057_score_sde', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Predictor</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">数值离散 reverse SDE 前进一步</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Predictor within the core continuous score sde computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"Langevin MCMC 在当前噪声尺度校正分布\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Corrector within the core continuous score sde computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Corrector\" data-node-name-en=\"Corrector\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_057_score_sde', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Corrector</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">Langevin MCMC 在当前噪声尺度校正分布</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Corrector within the core continuous score sde computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"dx=[f-0.5g^2 s_theta]dt，与 SDE 共享边缘分布且为确定性\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies PF-ODE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"PF-ODE\" data-node-name-en=\"PF-ODE\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_057_score_sde', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>PF-ODE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">dx=[f-0.5g^2 s_theta]dt，与 SDE 共享边缘分布且为确定性</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies PF-ODE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"reverse SDE/PC 或 PF-ODE 的 t=0 端点\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces samples generated via predictor-corrector reverse sde or exact likelihoods via probability-flow ode via Synthesized Sample.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"生成样本\" data-node-name-en=\"Synthesized Sample\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_057_score_sde', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生成样本</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Synthesized Sample</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">reverse SDE/PC 或 PF-ODE 的 t=0 端点</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces samples generated via predictor-corrector reverse sde or exact likelihoods via probability-flow ode via Synthesized Sample.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Score-SDE Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 同一 score 的反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Continuous-Time Forward/Reverse SDE &amp; Marginal-Equivalent Probability-Flow ODE</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Score-SDE：核心公式 · 同一 score 的反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"57\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"20.487145pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 a